# Dolibarr language file - en_US - emmcp
Module491412Name = emMCP
Module491412Desc = Exposes Dolibarr as a remote MCP server (OAuth 2.1) for AI clients
EmmcpName=emMCP
EmmcpDescription=Remote MCP server for Dolibarr
EmmcpDescriptionDetail=Exposes your Dolibarr as an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server over HTTP. Connect Claude, Claude Code or any MCP-compatible AI agent to your ERP: browse and manage third parties, invoices, products, orders, projects, documents… with the permissions of the user tied to the API key.
EmmcpSetup=emMCP setup
EmmcpSetupIntro=This module exposes an MCP endpoint (Streamable HTTP). Each client authenticates with a Dolibarr user's API key, or via OAuth 2.1 for claude.ai connectors: either way, actions are performed with that user's permissions, through the REST API.

